#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/utility-i/extracted-outputs/1c4ede0c-e865-41fe-9b38-8ecf39afa64f-0.avif)\n"
